        "original_id": "95397db4-5950-5eae-9c23-1cb01c65aa62",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lisa Simpson, Matt Groening, James L. Brooks, Helena Štáchová\n- Roles: cartoonist, writer, producer, animator, voice actor, voice actress\n- Products: The Simpsons\n- Topics: character creation, Czech dubbing\n\nFacts:\n- Matt Groening was born on February 15, 1954, and he is an American cartoonist, writer, producer, animator, and voice actor.\n- Matt Groening created and designed Lisa Simpson while waiting to meet James L. Brooks.\n- Helena Štáchová provided the Czech-language voice of Lisa Simpson in the Czech version of the American animated sitcom The Simpsons.",
